ng></p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: times new roman; MARGIN: 0px 0px 0px 1.6pt; text-align:center;"><strong>SECURITIES AND EXCHANGE COMMISSION</strong></p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: times new roman; MARGIN: 0px 0px 0px 2.55pt; text-align:center;"><strong>Washington, D.C. 20549</strong></p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: times new roman; MARGIN: 0px; text-align:justify;">&#160;</p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: times new roman; MARGIN: 0px 0px 0px 2.55pt; text-align:center;"><strong><span style="font-size:18pt">FORM <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2026-07-28to2026-07-28" name="dei:DocumentType" id="ixv-332">8-K</ix:nonNumeric></span></strong></p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: times new roman; MARGIN: 0px 0px 0px 2.55pt; text-align:center;"><strong>(Amendment No. )</strong></p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: times new roman; MARGIN: 0px; text-align:justify;">&#160;</p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: times new roman; MARGIN: 0px 0px 0px 2.2pt; text-align:center;"><strong>CURRENT REPORT</strong></p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: times new roman; MARGIN: 0px; text-align:justify;">&#160;</p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: times new roman; MARGIN: 0px 0px 0px 1.7pt; text-align:center;">PURSUANT TO SECTION 13 OR 15(d) OF THE SECURITIES EXCHANGE ACT OF 1934</p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: times new roman; MARGIN: 0px; text-align:justify;">&#160;</p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: times new roman; MARGIN: 0px 0px 0px 1.9pt; text-align:center;">Date of Report (Date of earliest event reported): <strong><span style="text-decoration:underline"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2026-07-28to2026-07-28" name="dei:DocumentPeriodEndDate" format="ixt:datemonthdayyearen" id="ixv-333">July 28, 2026</ix:nonNumeric></span></strong></p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: times new roman; MARGIN: 0px; text-align:justify;">&#160;</p><table style="border-spacing:0;font-size:10pt;text-align:jus